      "row_index_0based": 15,
      "serialized_row_index": 15,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ハロウィンの夜、モンスター娘たちが特別な夜を楽しむ中、\n主人公たちはネルやカヅネ、ルネルカら、\n『ルネルカヅネ探検隊』と出会う。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "ebe3ceccc929df7d8e33963e50ab5022e0a608dd8ea5d2900c58893f0370ce18",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "彼女らの目的は、このハロウィンの夜に突如現れたと噂の、\nお菓子でできた家を見つけ出すこと。",
      "jp_sha256": "d9a1f88db05c183a0fa3d16ff292c0d4fa00e010524336a1f1d21a4128660bd8",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그녀들의 목적은 이 핼러윈 밤에 돌연 나타났다고 소문난\n과자로 만든 집을 찾아내는 것.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 21,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b017-20261110-09783baa3a87",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "014e229acf1d3c446db651f2d903ab55615dc459a439579062776446fc32a9cb:000001_-412049757419491311:g0:r20",
      "row_index_0based": 20,
      "serialized_row_index": 20,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "彼女らの目的は、このハロウィンの夜に突如現れたと噂の、\nお菓子でできた家を見つけ出すこと。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "d27703087a1df1f2d87a78cac418538ab6d0cc3651da1a0c99c341f40c9a26f3",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ルネルカの知り合いであり魔法に精通したハッグ娘、\nドルゼフィーダも合流し、密猟者を蹴散らしつつ、\n闇の森の探索を続けるのだった――。",
      "jp_sha256": "9f172c0a1119cd0df26b41be8f1f4fcd2b4d9ccf1ba88c03a916ab4b68bb49dd",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "루네르카의 지인이자 마법에 정통한 해그 소녀,\n돌제피다도 합류해 밀렵꾼을 쓸어버리며,\n어둠의 숲 탐색을 계속했다――.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 26,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b017-20261110-09783baa3a87",
      "review_note": "원문 의미·문장 연결·자연스러움 교정",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "014e229acf1d3c446db651f2d903ab55615dc459a439579062776446fc32a9cb:000001_-412049757419491311:g0:r25",
      "row_index_0based": 25,
      "serialized_row_index": 25,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ルネルカの知り合いであり魔法に精通したハッグ娘、\nドルゼフィーダも合流し、密猟者を蹴散らしつつ、\n闇の森の探索を続けるのだった――。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
